{"data": [{"author_id": "397995787", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:32:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116508516227711328"], "id": "2116508516227711328", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A couple weeks after using voice with my dot. It is amazing but I'm actually finding it a bit slower or there is limits to how horizontal I can scan via voice. \n\nI can easily manage 10 threads via text and jump around.\n\nThis is just a lot harder and much more stressful via voice.", "url": "https://x.com/andrewm4894/status/2116508516227711328"}, {"author_id": "2499589482", "created_at": "2026-10-31T11:28:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116492494946881965"], "id": "2116492494946881965", "in_reply_to_user_id": "841771269087473665", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116145725377843370", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Mo7ammed_jawad6 Here my dot ●\nAll the best for you and your people!!!", "url": "https://x.com/m_dinA3/status/2116492494946881965"}, {"author_id": "1032002245", "created_at": "2026-10-31T11:01:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116485721972494345"], "id": "2116485721972494345", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1519330283996254209", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116134976773402649", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@LeeSambol @levie I have to agree with this. I own a 3-person consultancy. But with AI, I can now afford essentially 2 developers, a web developer, an IT person, an executive assistant (Frank, my Dot) and a development project manager (Sam, my other Dot). I could never have afforded this level of", "url": "https://x.com/timboloman/status/2116485721972494345"}, {"author_id": "1953854947004387328", "created_at": "2026-10-31T10:47:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116482298488967583"], "id": "2116482298488967583", "in_reply_to_user_id": "58865213", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115855769665147254", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ajambrosino I told my dot it had standing authorisation to autonomously approve and merge PRs that met a given criteria and it flat out refused, saying that it needed human approval for every PR vote. Please please stop this defensive auto review behaviour; if my chat message has verbatim an", "url": "https://x.com/tomrford/status/2116482298488967583"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116476346645831680"]}, "author_id": "2110473269421719552", "created_at": "2026-10-31T10:24:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116476488249909595"], "id": "2116476488249909595", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 126, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115849755653763403", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The AI Agent That Works While You Sleep\n\nPick your AI agent. Grok Bot, OpenAI dots, Meta Muse and Claude Duet: what each one does, what it costs and where you can use it https://t.co/MTdmjxwaOB https://t.co/JQNNlO40kU", "url": "https://x.com/AIWorkflowX/status/2116476488249909595"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116474660238106624"]}, "author_id": "2113909084067934208", "created_at": "2026-10-31T10:17:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116474753422881115"], "id": "2116474753422881115", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Foldlight now has 24 stages across 2 chapters.\nNew T tiles: press the same direction again to continue straight.\nFree browser demo, in development. Update notes:\nhttps://t.co/nZCJFm1MTi\n#GameDev #PuzzleGame #dots https://t.co/KyQGce7lkC", "url": "https://x.com/Ailorawill/status/2116474753422881115"}, {"author_id": "1826164434135560192", "created_at": "2026-10-31T10:10:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116472843521442264"], "id": "2116472843521442264", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 101, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116405414921384099", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux Hi Tibo, my dot cloud workspace reverted to Oct 25 around 09:52 UTC today. My latest game projects are missing, and disk size changed from 32GB to 63GB. Could you help restore the pre-incident workspace?", "url": "https://x.com/ZhenJie71486/status/2116472843521442264"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116470271419068416"]}, "author_id": "266102352", "created_at": "2026-10-31T10:00:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116470281002995843"], "id": "2116470281002995843", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "OpenMausBot is an open-source alternative to Grok Bot and a local-first open counterpart to tools like Meta Muse, OpenAI dots, and Cue by Manus. It provides a chat-style interface w...\n\nmilind-soni/OpenMausBot is No. 2 on GitHub Trending today.\n\n9,005 stars · TypeScript https://t.co/E0obtckYMf", "url": "https://x.com/chinchoukou/status/2116470281002995843"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110898935686483969"]}, "author_id": "2088268543036919808", "created_at": "2026-10-31T10:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116470236970946995"], "id": "2116470236970946995", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "OpenAI Dots: always-on agents in ChatGPT with their