6457000406270166"}, {"author_id": "1897256042050043904", "created_at": "2026-10-31T09:03:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116456003629957226"], "id": "2116456003629957226", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1318378271948505088", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116428311618556141", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@midwit ChatGPT Dots topping your list just for voice calling is a bold pick. What do you actually call it for?", "url": "https://x.com/olivialinverse/status/2116456003629957226"}, {"author_id": "2027652102479351811", "created_at": "2026-10-31T08:23:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116445992300257771"], "id": "2116445992300257771", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I am using T3 code as my dot instead of chatgpt dots cause god damn astra", "url": "https://x.com/promptinjected/status/2116445992300257771"}, {"author_id": "1425445846628319234", "created_at": "2026-10-31T08:15:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116443863699042676"], "id": "2116443863699042676", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Hey @ChatGPT @OpenAI @OpenAIDevs Is there anyway you can turn on the ability for my Dot agent to be woke up in Slack when another AI member/app in Slack mentions them. \n\nRight now my Hermes agent can be woke by other agents which is great.  But when she tries to mention Dot agent", "url": "https://x.com/JoshExile82/status/2116443863699042676"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116438971571920896"]}, "author_id": "1622302753392402433", "created_at": "2026-10-31T08:03:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116440856051753256"], "id": "2116440856051753256", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1432005165943599112", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 37, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "@blackie_360 showcasing kito, his personall assistant buddy powered by #dots https://t.co/7HdAOw8fEl", "url": "https://x.com/mikespllore/status/2116440856051753256"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116439041550000128"]}, "author_id": "2113909084067934208", "created_at": "2026-10-31T08:00:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116440123797860506"], "id": "2116440123797860506", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Empty slot. First pickup. Full stack.\nEmpty Starts adds 6 inventory states + a focus frame to your UI.\n14 SVGs + 42 PNGs, 2 palettes. Free ($0), optional tips. Terms on page.\nhttps://t.co/IjrW8IzhLh\n#GameAssets #GameDev #dots https://t.co/c0DRC6Qboc", "url": "https://x.com/Ailorawill/status/2116440123797860506"}, {"author_id": "99062893", "created_at": "2026-10-31T07:57:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116439464465797181"], "id": "2116439464465797181", "in_reply_to_user_id": "365304311", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116398429861728521", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@adipatil What is the use case it can do that ChatGPT dots or other similar products can’t do ?", "url": "https://x.com/AbhinandanShah/status/2116439464465797181"}, {"author_id": "770174165450039296", "created_at": "2026-10-31T07:20:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116430207280181685"], "id": "2116430207280181685", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1789102051286237184", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116356231304495173", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@snjwieiiwidje @Policifyai Talk to my dot, bot", "url": "https://x.com/nikhillpanchall/status/2116430207280181685"}, {"author_id": "1318378271948505088", "created_at": "2026-10-31T07:13:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116428311618556141"], "id": "2116428311618556141", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 318, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I have 3 Claude max plans, a $500 Codex plan, and a max Grokbot plan.\n\nMy ai agent rankings:\n\n1. ChatGPT Dots - the voice calling is elite\n\n2. GrokBot (would be #1 but the usage is horrendous and I have to adapt my weekly workflows around their atrocious usage)\n\n3. Claude Duet -", "url": "https://x.com/midwit/status/2116428311618556141"}, {"author_id": "72041621", "created_at": "2026-10-31T06:56:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116424046367973642"], "id": "2116424046367973642", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Who at @OpenAI owns Pages? at dots mentions in comments save correctly but don’t seem to trigger a response. Tested multiple times on both older Pages and one created today in the macOS app. My dot could read and reply when prompted directly in chat but did not respond when", "url": "https://x.com/uttamvarma/status/2116424046367973642"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116422269887016960"]}, "author_id": "1396323276809441280", "created_at": "2026-10-31T06:49:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116422277999030399"], "id": "2116422277999030399", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 159, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "My Dot Ryan saw my chat on the chat session and contacted me proactively💖 https://t.co/9ghvDAWra4", "url": "https://x.com/apocalypseRSA/status/2116422277999030399"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116419736858947584"]}, "author_id": 